msgid "main.welcome-message"
msgstr ""
"Hello and welcome, my name is Toni Zana. I make games, engines and little programs as "
"both a hobby and a job.\n"
"With several projects on both [color=#97fff6][url={\"url\": \"https://itch.io/profile/"
"potassium-shot\"}]itch.io[/url][/color] and [color=#97fff6][url={\"url\": \"https://"
"github.com/potassium-shot\"}]github[/url][/color], I am coming out of 5 years of studies "
"at Isart Digital (as a gameplay programmer), as well as a 2 year apprenticeship at "
"[color=#97fff6][url={\"project\": \"uid://bc4mi6sb8bskl\"}]Dada! Animation[/url][/"
"color].\n"
"I like working in small teams, and what thrills me the most is working on programming "
"architecture and complex systems.\n"
"This portfolio was made entirely by hand inside of the Godot engine."

